E: y² = x³ + 2x + 2 (mod 17)
(5, 1) + (6, 3) = (10, 6)

$ practice_02 sub 5,1 6,3
E: y² = x³ + 2x + 2 (mod 17)
(5, 1) − (6, 3) = (5, 16)

$ practice_02 mul 7 5,1
E: y² = x³ + 2x + 2 (mod 17)
7 × (5, 1) = (0, 6)

$ practice_02 mul -- -3 5,1
E: y² = x³ + 2x + 2 (mod 17)
-3 × (5, 1) = (10, 11)

$ practice_02 mul 0 5,1
E: y² = x³ + 2x + 2 (mod 17)
0 × (5, 1) = O

$ practice_02 linear 2 5,1 3 6,3
